{"root":"cemburu","ipa":"/tʃəmburu/","core":"嫉妒，吃醋，猜忌","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃəmburu/","zh":"指因爱慕对象与他人亲近而产生的嫉妒心理，或对他人成就产生的羡慕嫉妒感。","phrases":[{"t":"cemburu buta","zh":"盲目嫉妒，无理取闹的吃醋"},{"t":"rasa cemburu","zh":"嫉妒感"},{"t":"cemburu sosial","zh":"社会性嫉妒（指贫富差距引发的心理）"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia merasa cemburu melihat pacarnya berbicara dengan orang lain.","zh":"看到女朋友和别人说话，他感到很嫉妒。"},{"t":"Janganlah cemburu dengan kesuksesan orang lain.","zh":"不要嫉妒别人的成功。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cemburu","ipa":"/tʃəmburu/","zh":"嫉妒的","phrase":{"t":"sifat cemburu","zh":"嫉妒的性格"},"example":{"t":"Dia orang yang sangat cemburu.","zh":"他是一个非常爱嫉妒的人。"}},{"w":"mencemburui","ipa":"/mənʃəmburui/","zh":"嫉妒某人，对某人产生猜忌","phrase":{"t":"mencemburui pasangan","zh":"嫉妒伴侣"},"example":{"t":"Jangan mencemburui keberhasilan temanmu sendiri.","zh":"不要嫉妒你朋友自己的成就。"}},{"w":"kecemburuan","ipa":"/kətʃəmburuan/","zh":"嫉妒心，嫉妒感（名词）","phrase":{"t":"rasa kecemburuan yang besar","zh":"强烈的嫉妒心"},"example":{"t":"Kecemburuan bisa merusak hubungan.","zh":"嫉妒心会破坏关系。"}}],"derSlugs":["cemburu","mencemburui","kecemburuan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:35:38.263Z","src":"base"}